---
import { withBase, withBaseSrcset } from '../lib/urls';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
const { standalone=false }=Astro.props;
---
<section class:list={['studio-story',{'studio-story-standalone':standalone}]} id={standalone?'studio-details':'studio'}>
 <div class="studio-story-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE STUDIO / THE COLLABORATION</p><h2>Every detail.<br/><em>In service of the story.</em></h2></div>
 <div class="studio-story-grid">
  <article class="studio-story-copy"><span class="studio-step">01 <span>/ THE RECORDING</span></span><h3>A dedicated space.<br/>A considered sound.</h3><p>Inside my double-wall SessionBooth, a Lewitt LCT 540 S microphone captures the performance. A quiet, dedicated space to give your words my full attention.</p><div class="studio-spec"><span>SessionBooth</span><span>Lewitt LCT 540 S</span></div><a class="text-link" href={withBase(standalone?'/contact':'/studio')}>{standalone?'Discuss your recording':'Explore the studio'}<Icon name="external" size={18}/></a></article>
  <figure class="studio-story-photo"><img src={withBase('/media/concepts/microphone-close-1200.webp')} srcset={withBaseSrcset('/media/concepts/microphone-close-600.webp 600w, /media/concepts/microphone-close-1200.webp 1200w')} sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 45vw" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" alt="AI-generated studio concept: close-up of a silver microphone and shockmount inspired by Kitty’s equipment"/><figcaption>01 / BEHIND THE VOICE <span>Studio concept</span></figcaption></figure>
  <article class="studio-story-copy"><span class="studio-step">02 <span>/ THE CONNECTION</span></span><h3>Your direction.<br/>Our session.</h3><p>Listen in, share a thought, try another read. Join me remotely through SourceConnect, Cleanfeed, Zoom or SessionLink, wherever your team is based.</p><div class="studio-spec"><span>SourceConnect</span><span>Cleanfeed</span><span>Zoom</span><span>SessionLink</span></div><a class="text-link" href={withBase('/contact')}>Plan a directed session<Icon name="external" size={18}/></a></article>
  <figure class="studio-story-photo studio-story-photo-desk"><img src={withBase('/media/concepts/desk-close-1200.webp')} srcset={withBaseSrcset('/media/concepts/desk-close-600.webp 600w, /media/concepts/desk-close-1200.webp 1200w')} sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 45vw" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" alt="AI-generated studio concept: headphones and a compact red audio interface inspired by Kitty’s recording desk"/><figcaption>02 / LET’S LISTEN TOGETHER <span>Studio concept</span></figcaption></figure>
 </div>
 <div class="studio-story-bottom"><p>Close-up images are AI-generated concepts inspired by Kitty’s existing studio photographs.</p><a href={withBase('/studio/#original-photos')}>View original photography <Icon name="external" size={15}/></a></div>
</section>
